📚 CV System Commands

GENERATE:
  ./cv Google           Generate CV from clipboard YAML

OPEN:
  ./open                Open most recent CV
  ./open Google         Open specific CV
  ./open latest         Browse all CVs (menu)

WORKFLOW:
  1. Claude Projects → paste job → copy YAML (Cmd+C)
  2. ./cv Google
  3. Done!

SETUP (one-time):
  claude.ai → Projects → New "CV Tailoring"
  Instructions: paste from CLAUDE_PROJECTS_INSTRUCTIONS.txt

DOCS:
  CHEATSHEET.md         Quick reference
  WORKFLOW.md           Full guide

EOF
